        "title": "种: measure compatible referents",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "种 counts kinds, not necessarily individual objects. Two kinds may include many individual items.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我喜欢这种茶。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ xǐhuan zhè zhǒng chá 。",
                "meaning": "I like this kind of tea.",
